WEBVTT

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.448
THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:46.105
We participate in local events
and plan our own events at times as well.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:48.900
That's the sort of thing
our Women's Association does.

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:52.362
And you want me to join?

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.615
There are quite a few men
at many of the events.

00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:59.077
We've been thinking
that we ought to include male members too.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.703
There's an exec meeting today

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.541
with all the leaders
of the town's eight Women's Associations.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.919
We call ourselves "The Eight Dragons."

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:10.171
"The Eight Dragons."

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:14.467
So we're gonna go raid the Eight Dragons?

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:15.969
Oh, no. I'm introducing you.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:19.389
The Eight Dragons
needs a change in protocol

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.642
so that the Women's Association
can include male members.

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:25.103
The ladies are already waiting for us.

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:26.020
Yo!

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:37.407
I leave no bargain unexploited.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.367
YOKO THE VIKING

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.953
I purchased a Benz through budgeting.

00:02:42.036 --> 00:02:43.830
KOBAYASHI THE ALCHEMIST

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:45.957
What's your best score?

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.042
ARAI THE GRAND GOLFER

00:02:48.126 --> 00:02:52.297
Come to me if you want to know
all the hot goss on the streets!

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.257
TSUTSUMISHITA THE MEDIA QUEEN

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.760
Just hearing "neighborhood cleanup"
makes me quiver with anticipation.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.804
TERADA THE CLEANER

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:02.557
Flower arrangement is an art
interwoven with the seasons.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.517
KITAGAWA THE MASTER FLORAL DESIGNER

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:07.270
I mainly do volunteer work!

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.480
CHONO THE BUDDHA

00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:12.692
I am from the Fukuda family,
whose history spans four centuries.

00:03:12.775 --> 00:03:14.819
I am the chairwoman.

00:03:14.903 --> 00:03:16.696
FUKUDA THE LAND BARONESS

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.657
So these are the Eight Dragons!

00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:22.118
The air they carry isn't that of amateurs.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:25.079
These are all seasoned housewives.

00:03:25.663 --> 00:03:27.749
So you're here by Chono's recommendation?

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.293
Quite young, isn't he?

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.794
What business are you in?

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:36.466
I work full-time as a househusband
in Katagi-cho. My name is Tatsu!

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.009
It's an honor to meet you!

00:03:38.092 --> 00:03:39.969
Full-time househusband, eh?

00:03:41.846 --> 00:03:46.017
Well then, Tatsu.
Would you mind serving us some tea?

00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:48.019
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.479
BEEP

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.730
RUSTLE

00:03:52.148 --> 00:03:52.982
Please enjoy.

00:03:56.486 --> 00:03:58.154
Castella sponge cake, I see.

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:02.116
BAM

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.034
SWIFT

00:04:05.328 --> 00:04:06.454
RUSTLE

00:04:06.537 --> 00:04:08.289
LOVELY

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:12.460
All she did was display flowers,

00:04:12.543 --> 00:04:15.672
but all at once,
the space feels fresh and bright!

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:20.468
Refined flowers for the guest table…

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:23.179
Surely anyone could manage as much.

00:04:24.013 --> 00:04:26.933
Your admission
into the Women's Association?

00:04:27.517 --> 00:04:28.893
I disapprove.

00:04:28.977 --> 00:04:30.353
I SHALL HAVE A PIECE TOO

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:37.652
Your admission into
the Women's Association? I disapprove.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:40.279
Your abilities are insufficient.

00:04:40.363 --> 00:04:42.573
You lack refinement and grace.

00:04:42.657 --> 00:04:46.703
I'm prepared to dedicate myself
entirely to the organization!

00:04:47.286 --> 00:04:49.914
Please take me under your wings!

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:56.129
My wings?

00:04:56.212 --> 00:04:58.464
If you wish to learn
refinement and grace,

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:02.677
come to Kitagawa Flower Arrangement class,
held three times a week!

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.930
Day classes begin at 1:00 p.m.
Evening classes at 6:00 p.m.

00:05:06.014 --> 00:05:08.224
There are three types of courses. Lessons…

00:05:16.274 --> 00:05:17.734
Don't kill it! Channel its life!

00:05:18.317 --> 00:05:19.694
Be bold but delicate!

00:05:20.361 --> 00:05:21.654
Listen to the flowers!

00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:24.115
The flowers can't bury your spirit!

00:05:24.782 --> 00:05:26.576
Become one with the flowers!

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:36.252
NINKYO COMMUNITY CENTER

00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:39.130
GRACEFUL

00:05:40.256 --> 00:05:41.132
SWIFT

00:05:46.262 --> 00:05:48.014
No doubt about it.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.641
He's a changed man.

00:05:51.476 --> 00:05:53.436
His every gesture

00:05:54.103 --> 00:05:55.605
emits splendor!

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.857
GRACEFUL, SWIFT, SOFT

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:00.318
-Oh my, what lovely flowers.
-Yes.

00:06:00.401 --> 00:06:02.111
What kind are they, I wonder?

00:06:02.653 --> 00:06:04.989
I've incorporated seasonal roses.

00:06:05.073 --> 00:06:06.324
Oh, how nice.

00:06:06.991 --> 00:06:11.454
They represent the great force with which
a digger truck smashed into a rival's HQ.

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:13.414
-I see.
-Interesting.

00:06:13.498 --> 00:06:16.751
Here I used poppies and miscanthus blooms.

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.127
Within the vividness,

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:22.965
I integrated the transience I felt
as my brothers fell during raids.

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:25.176
Hmm, I see.

00:06:25.259 --> 00:06:28.513
The concept here is a rising dragon!

00:06:28.596 --> 00:06:30.973
The concept is a rising dragon?

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:34.977
It's still raw,
but I sense the intention in your flowers.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:36.938
Like a rising dragon, indeed.

00:06:37.522 --> 00:06:40.942
You've risen to a new level
as a househusband.

00:06:41.025 --> 00:06:42.401
Did he really?

00:06:42.485 --> 00:06:46.114
I will accept your admission
into the Women's Association.

00:06:46.697 --> 00:06:49.617
Welcome to the Women's Association, Tatsu.

00:06:50.201 --> 00:06:54.122
From here on, you shall be known as
"Tatsu the Tablescape Coordinator."

00:06:54.205 --> 00:06:57.125
"Table"…? Yes, ma'am!

00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:58.167
FLOWER

00:07:02.713 --> 00:07:05.341
That's it, Gokudon! Coming to catch you!

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:09.053
You wanna arrest me, huh?
Better have a warrant, then!

00:07:09.137 --> 00:07:11.013
You've been caught red-handed.

00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:15.184
Tacchan, I have a favor to ask.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.894
What is it?

00:07:17.478 --> 00:07:18.312
Well…

00:07:19.647 --> 00:07:22.567
One of my friends' kids
is a big Policure fan.

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:27.738
I bought you Nakayosu magazine.
Won't you read it?

00:07:28.573 --> 00:07:30.449
I want to go home already.

00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:32.660
You'll be discharged in five days.

00:07:32.743 --> 00:07:34.912
Look, your favorite Policure story
is in here.

00:07:35.496 --> 00:07:37.373
I'm never going to get better.

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:41.127
Actually, you're going
to have a visitor today.

00:07:41.919 --> 00:07:43.129
SLIDE

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.216
'Scuse me, ladies.

00:07:48.176 --> 00:07:49.927
Wait, did I get the right room?

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:51.637
Why, look at that, Maho!

00:07:51.721 --> 00:07:53.598
Gokudon's here to see you.

00:07:53.681 --> 00:07:57.059
Hello. Gokudon here.

00:07:58.603 --> 00:08:01.647
I brought the stash I mentioned.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.985
That's the popular fruit selection
from the Mafia Marché!

00:08:06.068 --> 00:08:07.612
There was a line for it.

00:08:07.695 --> 00:08:10.323
You went through so much trouble!
Thank you so much!

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:14.452
PEEL PEEL

00:08:15.036 --> 00:08:16.412
Please, help yourself.

00:08:16.495 --> 00:08:19.957
Wow, thank you! How cute is that?

00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:21.125
Bunny rabbits…

00:08:21.209 --> 00:08:23.336
This is for you, ma'am.

00:08:23.419 --> 00:08:25.087
You even brought a cushion?

00:08:30.301 --> 00:08:31.802
He's so skilled!

00:08:31.886 --> 00:08:35.431
-The flower food will keep them fresh too.
-Oh, okay!

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.892
That's it, Gokudon!

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:40.353
What?! Policure's here!

00:08:40.436 --> 00:08:42.188
-It's Policure!
-Is that Miku?

00:08:42.813 --> 00:08:43.648
Bang!

00:08:46.651 --> 00:08:48.778
Popping a cap on sight?

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.072
You've got some moxie!

00:08:51.155 --> 00:08:52.073
SPRAY SPRAY

00:08:53.616 --> 00:08:54.533
You're wide open!

00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:55.451
THWACK

00:08:56.786 --> 00:08:57.995
Curse you, Gokudon!

00:08:59.205 --> 00:09:00.331
Didn't follow through.

00:09:00.414 --> 00:09:04.460
I'll finish you off before
some lively kid comes to cheer you on!

00:09:04.543 --> 00:09:07.713
Before a lively kid comes to cheer you on!

00:09:09.507 --> 00:09:11.634
Go ahead, Maho! Cheer Policure on.

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:15.846
You can do it, Policure!

00:09:17.431 --> 00:09:19.600
Feel the thrust of justice!

00:09:20.351 --> 00:09:23.396
So this is the power of a child's cheer!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.526
I'll let you off for today…

00:09:29.443 --> 00:09:32.321
Wow, you did it, Maho!

00:09:33.197 --> 00:09:34.031
Yeah.

00:09:34.115 --> 00:09:36.742
Ahem. Excuse me.

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:40.204
The overall narrative works,
but it's too fast-paced.

00:09:40.288 --> 00:09:43.207
Wipe the blood later too.
It ruins the pacing.

00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:44.667
It's a turn-off.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.296
You glanced at Maho
when you mentioned kids cheering.

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:52.049
I get it, but it's too much pressure.
You basically forced her.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.927
Also, you do know this is a hospital?

00:09:55.011 --> 00:09:57.722
Oh, well… Yes.

00:09:57.805 --> 00:09:59.098
HONESTLY…

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.687
EPISODE 70

00:10:08.691 --> 00:10:09.609
WHOOSH

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:12.028
An autumn breeze blows

00:10:12.111 --> 00:10:14.530
I take the wrong route running
Errands for my wife

00:10:16.073 --> 00:10:17.033
I see.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.743
Exquisite as always, sir.

00:10:19.327 --> 00:10:23.873
How about it, Tatsu?
Are you surprised that I dabble in haiku?

00:10:24.665 --> 00:10:26.834
I was right to bring him
to the Haiku Club.

00:10:26.917 --> 00:10:28.836
I'm going to impress him today.

00:10:28.919 --> 00:10:30.296
WHOOSH

00:10:30.379 --> 00:10:32.882
A metal barrel
Sinks deep under the water

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:34.008
Of the Japan Sea

00:10:34.759 --> 00:10:36.344
A metal barrel?

00:10:37.428 --> 00:10:41.515
Well, I suppose the ocean has become
polluted as of late, and we no longer--

00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:42.558
One more!

00:10:43.142 --> 00:10:44.310
A grand moonlit raid

00:10:44.393 --> 00:10:46.771
Done on a mid-autumn night
With all of the gang

00:10:47.355 --> 00:10:49.231
He clearly said "raid."

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:53.944
Hmm. "Moonlit." I see.

00:10:55.237 --> 00:10:56.655
Winter waterboarding

00:10:56.739 --> 00:10:59.325
When the boss is not content
A dip in the pond

00:10:59.408 --> 00:11:00.868
Bamboo leaves rustle

00:11:00.951 --> 00:11:03.371
As the black suits cut through it
Deep in the mountain

00:11:03.454 --> 00:11:05.915
Neck-deep in debt and--

00:11:05.998 --> 00:11:09.835
All right, let's give
that theme a break, Tatsu.

00:11:11.087 --> 00:11:12.296
On an autumn plain…

00:11:13.839 --> 00:11:15.591
Is that the Bears?

00:11:15.674 --> 00:11:19.136
Huh? Oh, been a while, brother!

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.055
-Hello.
-What are you doing?

00:11:21.138 --> 00:11:24.266
We run a haiku club called "The Sparrows."

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.728
So you lot are bards too?

00:11:27.812 --> 00:11:32.191
Actually, we've been hooked
into the world of haiku recently as well.

00:11:32.274 --> 00:11:35.653
Care to have a haiku slam?

00:11:36.487 --> 00:11:37.321
A haiku slam?!

00:11:39.824 --> 00:11:42.034
So high in the sky
The fluttering dragonflies

00:11:42.118 --> 00:11:43.702
Are too cute for words

00:11:43.786 --> 00:11:45.705
You nailed it, Boss!

00:11:45.788 --> 00:11:47.540
-Fluttering dragonflies!
-You see?

00:11:47.623 --> 00:11:49.041
"Fluttering dragonflies"?

00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:50.501
Let me handle this.

00:11:50.584 --> 00:11:52.920
Crimson dragonflies
They're really rather scary

00:11:53.003 --> 00:11:54.088
In such large numbers

00:11:54.171 --> 00:11:56.674
Yes, I totally get you! So scary!

00:11:56.757 --> 00:11:59.009
See what Pop's got, huh?!

00:11:59.093 --> 00:12:01.846
What?! It doesn't beat
"fluttering dragonflies"!

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:03.389
They're really excited.

00:12:03.472 --> 00:12:04.849
In the prime of youth

00:12:04.932 --> 00:12:07.852
While on the way home from school
We'll whistle at you

00:12:07.935 --> 00:12:10.604
-Yeah, you go! You guys are on fire!
-Fuego, baby!

00:12:10.688 --> 00:12:13.065
Check out this cricket
It's surprising how creepy

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:14.525
It looks in real life

00:12:14.608 --> 00:12:18.112
So true! It's surprisingly bug-like.
You're a master at this!

00:12:18.696 --> 00:12:19.613
PHEW

00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:22.867
Encouraging him is getting tiring.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:25.536
I was going to keep quiet,
but the poems are lame--

00:12:26.287 --> 00:12:27.288
Don't.

00:12:29.331 --> 00:12:30.750
They are just so round…

00:12:30.833 --> 00:12:32.209
And they can mess with our minds…

00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:33.669
Those paw pads of yours

00:12:33.753 --> 00:12:35.671
-It's great!
-It's great!

00:12:37.131 --> 00:12:38.591
The Househusband's Way…

00:12:40.759 --> 00:12:42.636
EPISODE 71

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.056
WHOOSH

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:49.685
Weighing in at one kilogram,
this baby is even cordless.

00:12:49.769 --> 00:12:53.022
And yet, it's oh so powerful!
Creases, be gone!

00:12:53.105 --> 00:12:56.859
With complete steam coverage too!
The end result is just out of this world!

00:12:56.942 --> 00:12:59.195
Not bad, newbie!

00:12:59.278 --> 00:13:01.530
Now let's smooth out all those folds!

00:13:02.782 --> 00:13:04.825
Phew. Here we go.

00:13:05.576 --> 00:13:06.494
CRACK

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.997
Hey, we're out of face wash--

00:13:12.041 --> 00:13:13.417
What happened?!

00:13:13.501 --> 00:13:16.921
I felt something in my lower back…

00:13:17.004 --> 00:13:18.255
It's a raid!

00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:20.216
Sounds like you threw out your back.

00:13:23.052 --> 00:13:26.055
What, me? That's a funny joke.

00:13:26.764 --> 00:13:31.143
This pain… I must have been sniped!

00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:34.021
No, you obviously threw out your back.

00:13:35.272 --> 00:13:38.359
They called me "Immortal."
There's no way I would throw my back--

00:13:38.984 --> 00:13:40.569
Don't underestimate me…

00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:41.821
I can barely hear you.

00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:43.989
I told you to stop it.

00:13:44.073 --> 00:13:44.907
I'm fine.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.326
Let me do it.

00:13:47.409 --> 00:13:48.536
Hands off!

00:13:48.619 --> 00:13:49.870
I said I'll do it!

00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:53.874
Wait! No, don't… Don't press it. Don't!

00:13:53.958 --> 00:13:58.712
By the way, throwing out your back is
apparently called a "witch shot" overseas.

00:13:58.796 --> 00:14:00.381
Kind of badass, isn't it?

00:14:01.924 --> 00:14:03.759
A witch shot?!

00:14:03.842 --> 00:14:06.136
Anyway, I'll make lunch, okay?

00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:07.471
No, wait!

00:14:07.555 --> 00:14:09.598
They say the best thing
for a strained back

00:14:09.682 --> 00:14:12.059
is to carry on as normal as possible.

00:14:12.142 --> 00:14:14.103
Can't take shots
from both a witch and Miku!

00:14:14.186 --> 00:14:15.020
ACK

00:14:15.771 --> 00:14:17.731
Well, we have no choice.

00:14:17.815 --> 00:14:20.276
We'll have to depend on delivery.

00:14:20.359 --> 00:14:21.610
It's not that big a deal.

00:14:22.903 --> 00:14:25.614
Yes. The cheese-filled hamburger patty.

00:14:25.698 --> 00:14:27.408
Yes… yes.

00:14:28.075 --> 00:14:29.869
Oh, please make it a meal.

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:31.537
BEEP

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.747
-This takes me back.
-Huh?

00:14:33.831 --> 00:14:35.833
The last time I leaned on your shoulders…

00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:38.377
This makes it twice, now.

00:14:38.961 --> 00:14:40.629
I actually ended up carrying you.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:44.258
Yeah, that was surprising.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.260
Hey, now.

00:14:46.343 --> 00:14:50.973
Must've been a rough scrap
for you to get like this.

00:14:51.056 --> 00:14:54.935
I messed up, Shige.

00:14:55.769 --> 00:14:57.146
I threw out my back.

00:14:57.229 --> 00:14:58.606
Is that it?

00:14:58.689 --> 00:15:01.191
I've always trusted your skills, Shige.

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:02.568
Please, help!

00:15:04.612 --> 00:15:05.988
Guess it can't be helped.

00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:09.700
I'll make sure you get
a week's worth of patches!

00:15:09.783 --> 00:15:10.659
SWING

00:15:10.743 --> 00:15:12.745
The Way of the Househusband…

00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:16.165
Hey, Miku.

00:15:16.248 --> 00:15:19.251
Apparently there was some perv
around the shopping district.

00:15:19.335 --> 00:15:20.669
It's in the newsletter.

00:15:20.753 --> 00:15:23.380
Really? I always pass through that area.

00:15:23.464 --> 00:15:24.381
That's scary.

00:15:24.965 --> 00:15:27.217
Teach me some self-defense, Tacchan.

00:15:27.301 --> 00:15:28.427
Self-defense?

00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:32.973
-Let's say someone grabs your arm.
-Okay.

00:15:33.557 --> 00:15:35.934
What the hell? Who are you with?!

00:15:36.018 --> 00:15:38.103
Mess with me on my turf

00:15:38.187 --> 00:15:41.231
and you'll lose more
than just your fingers!

00:15:41.315 --> 00:15:42.983
How are you gonna settle this?!

00:15:44.443 --> 00:15:45.611
Not what I meant.

00:15:49.156 --> 00:15:51.283
It's so late!

00:15:56.246 --> 00:15:58.123
Hey, Boss Lady! You must be tired--

00:15:58.207 --> 00:15:59.833
-You perv!
-I'm not!

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:01.293
You bloody perv!

00:16:01.377 --> 00:16:03.253
Boss Lady! It's me--

00:16:03.337 --> 00:16:07.257
Wait, it's me! It's me, Masa!

00:16:07.341 --> 00:16:08.300
Huh?

00:16:08.384 --> 00:16:09.259
It's Masa!

00:16:09.343 --> 00:16:10.844
Masa?

00:16:10.928 --> 00:16:12.262
Whee! Hey, Boss!

00:16:14.682 --> 00:16:17.851
Masa's face isn't that swollen!

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:21.230
Boss Lady… but it's me…
